  "speed": 0.9,
  "clips": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "Love.",
      "path": "audio/1971-184/01.mp3",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 0.626145
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "The journey is long and the path is pathless.",
      "path": "audio/1971-184/02.mp3",
      "start": 1.771429,
      "end": 4.0561
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "And one has to be alone - there is no map and no guide.",
      "path": "audio/1971-184/03.mp3",
      "start": 5.178367,
      "end": 8.544262999999999
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "But there is no alternative.",
      "path": "audio/1971-184/04.mp3",
      "start": 9.69644,
      "end": 10.941633
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "One cannot escape it, one cannot evade it.",
      "path": "audio/1971-184/05.mp3",
      "start": 12.086916,
      "end": 14.390906999999999
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "One has to go on the journey.",
      "path": "audio/1971-184/06.mp3",
      "start": 15.528798,
      "end": 16.80941
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "The goal seems impossible but the urge to go on it is intrinsic.",
      "path": "audio/1971-184/07.mp3",
      "start": 17.948843999999998,
      "end": 22.049161
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "The need is deep in the soul.",
      "path": "audio/1971-184/08.mp3",
      "start": 23.575419999999998,
      "end": 25.510363
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "Really, you are the urge, you are the need - and consciousness cannot be otherwise because of this challenge and because of this adventure.",
      "path": "audio/1971-184/09.mp3",
      "start": 27.130816,
      "end": 35.066032
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "So do not waste time - begin.",
      "path": "audio/1971-184/10.mp3",
      "start": 36.585329,
      "end": 39.71
    }
  ]
}
